ow us to maximize the efficiency and effectiveness of the meeting.\n\nWe are experiencing a period of rapid growth and innovation and Project Phoenix is central to our continued success. Your contributions are essential to achieving our goals.  We believe that by working together we can overcome any challenges and deliver a truly exceptional product.\n\nIf you are unable to attend the meeting please let me know as soon as possible so that we can ensure your input is incorporated. We will provide a detailed meeting summary and recording for those who cannot attend.\n\nThank you for your continued dedication and hard work. I look forward to a productive and insightful meeting.\n\nBest regards\n\n[Your Name]\n\n[Your Title]\n\n[Your Contact Information]\n\nAttachment: Project Phoenix Summary Document\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "Subject", "logprob": -0.000773250067140907}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -6.544376083184034e-05}, {"token": "▁Important", "logprob": -0.03818577155470848}, {"token": "▁Meeting", "logprob": -0.007039862219244242}, {"token": "▁Invitation", "logprob": -0.054651401937007904}, {"token": "▁Project", "logprob": -0.007509456016123295}, {"token": "▁Phoenix", "logprob": -0.12482722848653793}, {"token": "▁Initiative", "logprob": -2.2923078536987305}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.011139464564621449}, {"token": "Dear", "logprob": -0.0073452177457511425}, {"token": "▁Val", "logprob": -0.2633054554462433}, {"token": "ued", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁Team", "logprob": -0.08000598847866058}, {"token": "▁Members", "logprob": -0.00573939923197031}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.00014256415306590497}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -0.2595761716365814}, {"token": "▁hope", "logprob": -0.050987739115953445}, {"token": "▁this", "logprob": -4.887569048150908e-06}, {"token": "▁email", "logprob": -0.0006273209000937641}, {"token": "▁finds", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁you", "logprob": -0.00014149141497910023}, {"token": "▁well", "logprob": -0.00070785